#. Tag: title
#: using-kturtle.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kturtle;"
msgstr "Korištenje &kturtle;"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: using-kturtle.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here is a screenshot of &kturtle; in action"
msgstr "Ovdje je prikaz zaslona &kturtle; u akciji"

#. Tag: phrase
#: using-kturtle.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kturtle; Main Window"
msgstr "&kturtle; Glavni Prozor"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The main window of &kturtle; has three main parts: <link linkend=\"the-editor"
"\">the editor</link> (1) on the left where you type the &turtlescript; "
"commands, the <link linkend=\"the-canvas\">the canvas</link> (2) on the "
"right where the turtle make your drawing, and the <link linkend=\"the-"
"inspector\">inspector</link> (3) which gives you information when your "
"program executes. Besides these you find <link linkend=\"the-menubar\">the "
"menu bar</link> (5) from where all the actions can be reached, <link linkend="
"\"the-toolbar\">the toolbar</link> (4) that allows you to quickly select the "
"most used actions, the <guilabel>Console</guilabel>, that you can use to "
"enter a one line command to test it, and <link linkend=\"the-statusbar\">the "
"statusbar</link> (along the bottom of the window) where you will find "
"feedback on the state of &kturtle;."
msgstr ""
"Glavni prozor &kturtle; ima 3 glavna dijela: <link linkend=\"the-editor"
"\">uređivač</link> (1) na lijevoj strani gdje kucate &turtlescript; komade, "
"<link linkend=\"the-canvas\">platno</link> (2) na desnoj strani gdje "
"kornjača crta, i <link linkend=\"the-inspector\">inspektor</link> (3) koji "
"vam daje informacije o izvršenju programa. Pored njih možete naći <link "
"linkend=\"the-menubar\">izborničku traku</link> (5) gdje možete pristupiti "
"svim radnjama, <link linkend=\"the-toolbar\">alatna traka</link> (4) koja "
"vam omogućava da brzo odaberetenajčešće korištene radnje, <guilabel>Konzola</"
"guilabel>, gdje možete unijeti jednu liniju kao test, i <link linkend=\"the-"
"statusbar\">statusna traka</link> (pored dna prozora) gdje će te naći "
"povratne informacije o stanju &kturtle;."

#. Tag: title
#: using-kturtle.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Editor"
msgstr "Uređivač"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the editor you type the &turtlescript; commands. Most of functions of the "
"editor can be found in the <link linkend=\"the-file-menu\">File</link> and "
"<link linkend=\"the-edit-menu\">Edit</link> menus. The editor can be docked "
"on each border of the main window or it can be detached and placed anywhere "
"on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"U uređivaču kucate &kturtlesript; komande. Većina mogućnosti uređivača se "
"mogu naći u <link linkend=\"the-file-menu\">Datoteka</link> and <link "
"linkend=\"the-edit-menu\">Uredi</link> izbornicima. Uređivač je moguće "
"postaviti na svaku granicu glavnog prozora ili može biti odvojen i "
"postavljen bilo gdje na desktopu."

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have several ways to get some code in the editor. The easiest way is to "
"use an example: choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Examples</guisubmenu></menuchoice> in the <link linkend="
"\"the-file-menu\">File menu</link> and select an example. The file example "
"you choose will be opened in the <link linkend=\"the-editor\">the editor</"
"link>, you can then use <menuchoice><guimenu>Run</guimenu><guimenuitem>Run</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menubar or the <guibutton>Run</guibutton> "
"from the toolbar to run the code if you like."
msgstr ""
"Postoji par načina za unošenje koda u uređivač. Najlakši način je da "
"koristite primjer: odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Primjeri</guisubmenu></menuchoice> u <link linkend=\"the-"
"file-menu\">Datotečni izbornik</link> i odaberete primjer. Primjer datoteke "
"koju ste odabrali će biti otvoren u <link linkend=\"the-editor\">uređivač</"
"link>, potom možete koristiti <menuchoice><guimenu>Pokreni</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Pokreni</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz izborničke trake "
"ili <guibutton>Pokreni</guibutton> iz alatne trake da bi ste pokrenuli kod "
"koji želite."

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can open &turtlescript; files by choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Open...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Možete otvoriti &turtlescript; datoteku odabirući "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu><guimenuitem>Otvori...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The third way is to directly type your own code in the editor or to copy/"
"paste some code."
msgstr ""
"Treći način je da direktno otkucate aš kod u uređivaču ili ga kopirate i "
"zalijepite."

#. Tag: title
#: using-kturtle.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Canvas"
msgstr "Platno"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The canvas is the domain of the turtle, here the turtle draws according to "
"the commands it gets. After getting some code in the <link linkend=\"the-"
"editor\">Editor</link> and executing it, two things can happen: either the "
"code executes fine, and will you most likely see something change on the "
"canvas; or you have made an error in your code in that case the error tab "
"will appear explaining you what mistake you made."
msgstr ""
"Platno je u domenu kornjače, ovdje kornjača crta skladno komandama koje "
"dobije. Poslije dobivanja koda u  <link linkend=\"the-editor\">Uređivač</"
"link> i izvršavanja, moguće su dvije stvari: ili će se kod pravilno "
"izvršiti, i najvjerovatnije će te vidjeti promjene na platnu; ili ste "
"napravili grešku u vašem kodu, te u tom slučaju će pojaviti novi odjeljak "
"koji će vam ukazati na vaše greške."

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can zoom in and out the canvas with your mouse wheel."
msgstr "Možete uvečati i smanjiti platno koristeći srednje dugme na mišu."

#. Tag: title
#: using-kturtle.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Inspector"
msgstr "Inspektor"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The inspector informs you about the variables, the learned functions and "
"show the code tree while the program is running."
msgstr ""
"Inspektor vas obavještava o promjenljivim, naučenim funkcijama i pokazuje "
"drvo koda dok se program obavlja."

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The inspector can be docked on each border of the main window or it can be "
"detached and placed anywhere on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Inspektor može da se usidri na svakoj ivici glavnog prozora ili može biti "
"odvojen i smješten bilo gdje na vašem desktopu."

#. Tag: title
#: using-kturtle.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Toolbar"
msgstr "Alatna Traka"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can quickly reach the most used actions. The Toolbar also contains "
"the <guilabel>Console</guilabel> where you can quickly invoke commands, this "
"might be useful in case you want to test a command without modifying the "
"content of the <link linkend=\"the-editor\">Editor</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje vi možete brzo postići najviše korištenih akcija. Alatna Traka takođe "
"sadrži <guilabel>Konzolu</guilabel> gdje vi možete brzo pozvati komande, ovo "
"može biti korisno u slučaju da želite da testirate komandu bez modificiranja "
"sadržaja <link linkend=\"the-editor\">Uređivača</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can configure the toolbar using <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to "
"better fit your preferences."
msgstr ""
"Možete podesiti alatnu traku koristeći <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Podesi Alatnu Traku...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> da bi "
"vama više odgovarala."

#. Tag: title
#: using-kturtle.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Menubar"
msgstr "Izbornička Traka"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the menubar you find all the actions of &kturtle;. They are in the "
"following groups: <guimenu>File</guimenu>, <guimenu>Edit</guimenu>, "
"<guimenu>Canvas</guimenu>, <guimenu>Run</guimenu>, <guimenu>Tools</guimenu>, "
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu>, and <guimenu>Help</guimenu>. This section "
"describes them all."
msgstr ""
"Na Izborničkoj Traci pronaći ćete sve akcije &kturtle;. One su u sljedećim "
"grupama: <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu>, <guimenu>Uredi</guimenu>, "
"<guimenu>Platno</guimenu>, <guimenu>Pokreni</guimenu>, <guimenu>Alati</"
"guimenu>, <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu>, i <guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu>. Ovaj "
"odjeljak ih sve opisuje."

#. Tag: title
#: using-kturtle.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>File</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> Izbornik"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Novo</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creates a new, empty &turtlescript; file."
msgstr "Kreira novu, praznu &turtlescript; datoteku."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Open...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Otvori...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens a &turtlescript; file."
msgstr "Otvara &turtlescript; datoteku."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Open Recent</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Otvori Nedavno</guisubmenu>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens a &turtlescript; file that has been opened recently."
msgstr "Otvara &turtlescript; datoteku koja je skoro otvorena."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Examples</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Primjeri</guisubmenu>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open example &turtlescript; programs. The examples are in your favorite "
"language that you can choose in <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Script Language</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Otvarite primjere &turtlescript; programa. Primjeri su na vašem omiljenom "
"jeziku koji možete odabrati u <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Jezik Pisanja</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Get more examples...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Više primjera možete naći ...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open the get <guilabel>Hot New Stuff</guilabel> dialog to download "
"additional &turtlescript; files from the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Otvorite izdanak <guilabel>Vruća Nova Stvar</guilabel> dijalog da učitate "
"dodatne &turtlescript; datoteke sa Interneta."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Snimi</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves the currently opened &turtlescript; file."
msgstr "Snima trenutno otvorenu &turtlescript; datoteku."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save As...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Snimi Kao...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves the currently opened &turtlescript; file on a specified location."
msgstr "Snima trenutno otvorenu &turtlescript; datoteku na određenoj lokaciji."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Export to HTML...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Izvezi u HTML...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Exports the current content of the Editor as an HTML file that includes "
"highlighting colors."
msgstr ""
"Izvozi trenutni sadržaj Uređivača kao HTML datoteku koja uključuje boje za "
"označavanje."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Print...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Štampaj...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "Prints the current code in the editor."
msgstr "Štampa trenutni kod u uređivaču."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Ugasi</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quits &kturtle;."
msgstr "Ugasi &kturtle;."

#. Tag: title
#: using-kturtle.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "<guimenu>Uredi</guimenu> izbornik"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Undo</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Uredi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Vrati</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "Undoes the last change to code. &kturtle; has unlimited undos."
msgstr "Vraća zadnja promjenu koda. &kturtle; ima beskonačan broj vračanja."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Redo</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Uredi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>PonovoUradi</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid "Redoes an undone change to the code."
msgstr "Ponovo radi vraćene promjene koda."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>X</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Cut</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>X</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Uredi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Izreži</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Cuts the selected text from <link linkend=\"the-editor\">the editor</link> "
"to the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Reže odabrani dio teksta <link linkend=\"the-editor\">uređivač</link> na "
"tabelu."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Copy</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Uredi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Kopiraj</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Copies the selected text from <link linkend=\"the-editor\">the editor</link> "
"to the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Kopira odabrani dio teksta <link linkend=\"the-editor\">uređivač</link> na "
"tabelu."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>V</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Paste</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>V</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Uredi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zalijepi</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pastes the text from the clipboard to <link linkend=\"the-editor\">the "
"editor</link>."
msgstr ""
"Lijepi odabrani dio teksta <link linkend=\"the-editor\">uređivač</link> na "
"tabelu."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>A</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Select All</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>A</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Uredi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Odaberi Sve</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:251
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selects all the text from <link linkend=\"the-editor\">the editor</link>."
msgstr "Odabire sav tekst sa <link linkend=\"the-editor\">uređivač</link>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Find...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Uredi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Nađi...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid "With this action you can find phrases in the code."
msgstr "Sa ovom akcijom možete pronaći fraze u kodu."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo><keysym>F3</keysym></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Find Next</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo><keysym>F3</keysym></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Uradi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Pronađi Sljedeće </guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use this to find the next occurrence of the phrase you searched for."
msgstr "Koristite ovo da pronađete sljedeću pojavu fraze koju ste tražili."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Shift;<keysym>F3</keysym></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Find Previous</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo>&Shift;<keysym>F3</keysym></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Uredi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Pronađi Prethodno</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use this to find the previous occurrence of the phrase you searched for."
msgstr "Koristite ovo da pronađete prethodnu pojavu fraze koju ste tražili."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo><keycap>Ins</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Overwrite Mode</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo><keycap>Ubaci</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Uredi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Mod Za Pisanje Preko</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid "Toggle between the 'insert' and 'overwrite' mode."
msgstr "Prebacivač između moda \"ubaci\" i \"piši preko\"."

#. Tag: title
#: using-kturtle.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Canvas</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "<guimenu>Platno</guimenu> Izbornik"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Canvas</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Export to Image (PNG)...</guimenuitem>"
