"<guimenu>Canvas</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Export to Drawing (SVG)...</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu> Platno</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Izvezi u Crtež (SVG)...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Exports the current content of the <link linkend=\"the-canvas\">Canvas</"
"link> as a vector drawing of the SVG (Scalable Vector Graphics) type."
msgstr ""
"Izvozi trenutni sadržaj <link linkend=\"the-canvas\">Platna</link> kao "
