msgstr "Standardni &kde; dijalog da se podese kratice."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:520
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Podesi Alatne Trake...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:524
#, no-c-format
msgid "The standard &kde; dialog for configuring the toolbars."
msgstr "Standardni &kde; dijalog za podešavanje alatnih traka."

#. Tag: title
#: using-kturtle.docbook:530
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Help</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> Izbornik"

#. Tag: sect2
#: using-kturtle.docbook:530
#, no-c-format
msgid "&help.menu.documentation;"
msgstr "&help.menu.documentation;"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-kturtle.docbook:535
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo><keysym>F2</keysym></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Help on: ...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo><keysym>F2</keysym></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Pomoć oko: ...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:542
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a very useful function: it provides help on the code where the "
"cursor in the editor is at. So, &eg;, you have used the <userinput>print</"
"userinput> command in your code, and you want to read and to know what the "
"handbook says on this command. You just move your cursor so it is in the "
"<userinput>print</userinput> command and you press <keysym>F2</keysym>. The "
"handbook will then show all info on the <userinput>print</userinput> command."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je vrlo korisna funkcija: ona pruža pomoć oko koda gdje je kursor u "
"urađivaču. Tako, &eg;, vi ste koristili <userinput>štampaj</userinput> "
"komandu u vašem kodu, i želite da čitate i da znate šta priručnik kaže o "
"ovoj komandi. Vi samo pomjerite kursor tao da je na <userinput>štampaj </"
"userinput> komandi i pitisnite <keysym>F2</keysym>. Priručnik će onda "
"pokazati sve informacije o <userinput>štampaj</userinput> komandi."

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:543
#, no-c-format
msgid "This function can prove to be useful while learning &turtlescript;."
msgstr "Ova funkcija može se pokazati korisnom dok se uči &turtlescript;."

#. Tag: title
#: using-kturtle.docbook:552
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Statusbar"
msgstr "Statusna Traka"

#. Tag: para
#: using-kturtle.docbook:553
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the status bar you get feedback of the state of &kturtle;. On the left "
"side it shows the feedback on the last action. On the right side you find "
"the current location of the cursor (line and column numbers). In the middle "
"of the status bar is indicated the current language used for the commands."
msgstr ""
"Na statusnoj traci možete dobiti povratnu informciju o stanju &kturtle;. Na "
"lijevoj strani on pokazuje povratnu informaciju o zadnjoj akciji. Na desnoj "
"strani vi nalazite trenutnu lokaciju kursora (brojevi redova i kolona). U "
"sredini statusne trakepokazan je trenutni jezik koji se koristi za komande."
